src/kernels/build
# CUDA build artifacts under any crate. The legacy `src/kernels/build`
# pattern above stays for older checkouts that still carry it; this
# glob matches the `crates/<name>/src/kernels/build/` location used now.
**/src/kernels/build
# Metal backend build artifacts, same shape as the CUDA line above. The
# individual object and library patterns already cover the files; this keeps
# the directory itself out too. The recipe lives beside the CUDA one in
# `crates/ppf-cts-compute/metal`, so the glob names that directory rather than
# a path under a crate's `src/`.
**/ppf-cts-compute/metal/build
# The CUDA recipe's own default OUT_DIR, for a hand-run `make` in that
# directory. A cargo build passes OUT_DIR and writes nothing here, but
# regenerating a rendering or the kernel table by hand is a documented step and
# it lands in `build/` beside the recipe.
**/ppf-cts-compute/cuda/build
# The C++/CUDA regression binaries and their objects. The test Makefiles write
# them one level above the crate's src/, because two build scripts watch
# `crates/ppf-cts-solver/src` recursively and anything landing inside it
# invalidates both. This entry does NOT accomplish that: cargo's mtime walk
# does not consult .gitignore, so the directory has to sit outside the watch on
# its own merits and this line only keeps the results untracked. A root-anchored
# per-binary entry matches nothing here, because the solver sits under crates/,
# so one left in place lets a 1.2 MB ELF be tracked.
**/build-tests/

# The same defect one level down: a test Makefile invoked without its OUT
# override builds its binary in place, beside the source, which lands inside the
# watched tree AND is untracked by nothing. These are the names those Makefiles
# produce. Path-relative rather than root-anchored, for the reason above.
**/tests/test_pdrd_polar
**/tests/test_bend_aniso
**/tests/test_reduce
**/tests/test_exclusive_scan
**/tests/test_radix_sort
**/tests/test_pierce_underflow
**/tests/test_normalize_underflow
**/tests/test_cuda_arena
**/tests/test_cuda_diagnostics
**/tests/test_row_dedupe
**/tests/test_row_pattern
**/tests/test_accd_degenerate
**/tests/test_distance_coeff
**/tests/test_friction
**/tests/test_translation_lock
